Standard-conformance edits to the Hermes-Lite 2 radio core in
Hermes-Lite2-3e467fd-radioberry-pio.tar.xz (IEEE 1800-2005), applied by
tools/build.sh after unpacking it. radio.v's own edits are in this
project's copy, rtl/core/radio.sv.

- receiver.v, vna_scanner.v: body parameters CICRATE and RATE48 given a
  default (every instance sets them). The images no longer build
  vna_scanner.v; tools/sim.sh radioeq at bfeb533 simulates it.
- vna_scanner.v, receiver_nco.v: always @* blocks written always_comb,
  which also runs at time zero, so a simulator computes their outputs
  before the first clock as the hardware has them.

Both images are byte for byte the same with and without these edits.

